Z||000004||rogergarrison||01-26-2001||04:02 PM||||a quality tps comes with new screws. There only  supposed to be used once ,as in a headbolt. if one broke off try to use WD40 on it and an ez out or your going to have to drill it and tap it. I also use a dab of anti-sieze compound on all new bolts.||||reg||1
